The backend should return:

- Session ID.
- Acknowledged operation IDs.
- Rejected operation IDs.
- Operation-specific outcomes.
- Conflict information.
- Remote changes.
- Updated synchronization cursor.
- Server timestamp.

Implement incremental pull synchronization.

Avoid transferring the entire dataset during every synchronization.

Use server-generated synchronization cursors, sequence values, or another well-defined incremental mechanism.

